# tests/064-stand-in-room-folders.lua

A small stand-in for 101's `002-room-folders`, used by the tests in
`stand-in` mode.  Offers the contract's 101 functions (`open_home`,
`read_config`, `set_config`, `config_value`, `read_contacts`, `new_room_id`,
`create_room`, `read_room`, `write_name`, `write_parent`, `write_recipients`,
`list_rooms`, `room_exists`, `room_dir`, `log_path`, `on_change`, `notify`)
with the contract's inputs and outputs.  Unlike the real 101 it checks
nothing: it will write a circle of parents, an unknown parent, a `/` in a
name, or an unknown bell kind — which lets the tests reach people-links' own
checks for those.
